### Step 1: Upload the Business File
POST http://localhost:5000/api/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="caalLab2.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./caalLab2.txt
--MyBoundary--

###

### Step 2: Ask the Chatbot about the file
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": "Give me a summary of the uploaded file."
}